---
description: Harness session rules for Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing:
1. Read AGENTS.md
2. Run `node scripts/verify-session.mjs`
3. Claim work with a unique owner: `node harness/lock.mjs claim <key> --owner cursor-<session>`
4. Shared owners like `cursor` or `agent` are rejected
5. Do not use unapproved references
